{"id":"10b5af7aa0","t":"Rebirth: My Vengeance Through The Mirror","c":"cv","n":74,"l":74,"s":["ml","mg"],"k":{"ml":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror","mg":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror"},"u":1795768237858,"desc":"بعد خمسين عامًا من اندماج عالم الألعاب مع الواقع، ظهر محاربٌ عظيم. كرّس حياته كلها للعالم، ليُهابه ويُقتل على يد أعلى سلطة في النهاية. قبل وفاته، أيقظت لديه قدرةٌ على عكس المرآة، فختم روحه تحت سطح بحيرة. محا الحاكم التاريخَ واختلق تاريخًا جديدًا، ووصم المحارب بالخيانة. بعد عقود، استيقظ المحارب في جسد رجلٍ يحتضر، مستخدمًا قدرته على عكس المرآة، وبدأ انتقامه.","type":"مانها","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اكشن","خيال","قوة خارقة","نظام"],"src":{"ml":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror","mg":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror|/manga/rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror/1/","mg":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror|"},"2":{"ml":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror|/manga/rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror/2/","mg":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror|"},"3":{"ml":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror|/manga/rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror/3/","mg":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror|"},"4":{"ml":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror|/manga/rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror/4/","mg":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror|"},"5":{"ml":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror|/manga/rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror/5/","mg":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror|"},"6":{"ml":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror|/manga/rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror/6/","mg":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror|"},"7":{"ml":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror|/manga/rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror/7/","mg":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror|"},"8":{"ml":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror|/manga/rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror/8/","mg":"rebirth-my-vengeance-through-the-mirror|"},"